{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Citybus 628c &amp; 628g LF \u2013 add-on for OMSI 2 depicting realistic buses manufactured in Turkey, dedicated to Middle-East Europe, cheaper version of bus called a o530 produced in Germany. Most popular in Poland, Turkey and Hungary. Vehicles have realistic 3d model, textures and sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Addon includes 26 versions that differ in lengths, engines, gearboxes and driver\u2019s cabin. All versions have adjustable mirrors and steering column. Realistic control panels (two types) and a ticket printer manufactured in Poland (available in English, Polish, and German).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Buses can be configured by 38 setvars with total over 107 options. In addition, 89 different repaints of exterior and interior with upholstery from cities like Warsaw, Budapest, Istanbul. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478000/extras/omsi_features.png?t=1745586173\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">26 versions, differences:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- lengths: 12m (solo), 18m (articulated)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- engines: 4 types (different sounds and dashboard for each)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- gearboxes: 4 types (different sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- big and small driver\u2019s cabin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ingame setvar configurator panel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjustable mirrors and steering column</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic control panel (two types) and ticket printer from Poland (available in English, Polish and German)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">38 setvars with over 107 options of configuration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">89 realistic and semi realistic repaints of exterior and interior with different upholstery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic 3d model, textures and sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buses are repaintable</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1478000?t=1745586173","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1478000?t=1745586173","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745586173","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745586173","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Citybus 628c &amp; 628g LF \u2013 add-on for OMSI 2 depicting realistic buses manufactured in Turkey, dedicated to Middle-East Europe, cheaper version of bus called a o530 produced in Germany. Most popular in Poland, Turkey and Hungary. Vehicles have realistic 3d model, textures and sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Addon includes 26 versions that differ in lengths, engines, gearboxes and driver\u2019s cabin. All versions have adjustable mirrors and steering column. Realistic control panels (two types) and a ticket printer manufactured in Poland (available in English, Polish, and German).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Buses can be configured by 38 setvars with total over 107 options. In addition, 89 different repaints of exterior and interior with upholstery from cities like Warsaw, Budapest, Istanbul. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478000/extras/omsi_features.png?t=1745586173\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class